          {
            "title": "Question: Constructor",
            "id": 56060,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni nesneler oluşturmak için bir sınıfın içinde kullandığımız metot hangisidir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>constructor()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new Object()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>constructor</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>constructor()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir sınıfın içinde yeni oluşturulan her nesneyi hangi metot başlatır?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>constructor()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>new Object()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>constructor</code> özelliği</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>create()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>constructor()</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Parameters",
            "id": 108183,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"author\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parametreler constructor içinde olmalı</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir sınıf yalnızca bir parametreye sahip olabilir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parametreler constructor içinde olmalı.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf, her yeni kitap için bir <code>author</code> ve <code>title</code> değerine ihtiyaç duyar. Bu parametreler nereye yazılmalıdır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"author\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Constructor'ın içine</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir sınıf yalnızca bir parametreye sahip olabilir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sınıf adından sonra</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Constructor'ın içine öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Classes",
            "id": 108184,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Animal</code> için bir sınıf oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Class\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>class</code>, ardından <code>Animal</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıf adlarının büyük harfle başlaması kuralına uygun olarak <code>Animal</code> adlı boş bir sınıf oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Class\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"animal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>class</code>, ardından <code>Animal</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Constructor",
            "id": 108185,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Animal</code> sınıfına bir <code>constructor</code> ekle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>constructor</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>constructor</code>, yeni bir nesne oluşturulduğunda özellik değerlerini ayarlayan özel bir sınıf metodudur.</p><p><code>Animal</code> sınıfına boş bir <code>constructor</code> metodu ver.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Animal\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"31\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"constructor()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>constructor</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code> ve son olarak <code>}</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
