          {
            "title": "This",
            "id": 108171,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir nesne özelliği oluşturmadan önce özel bir anahtar kelimeye ihtiyacımız var: <code>this</code>. Oluşturulan nesneye başvurmak için <code>this</code> anahtar kelimesini ekleriz.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>this</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 108176,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir nesne özelliği oluşturmak için <code>this</code> anahtar sözcüğünün ardından bir nokta ve özellik adını kullanmamız gerekir.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>author</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni bir nesne özelliği oluşturmak için <code>this</code> anahtar sözcüğünün ardından nokta ve özellik adı kullanmalıyız. <code>author</code> özellik referansını tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"title\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"this()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>this</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve son olarak <code>author</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Assigning a value",
            "id": 108172,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni nesne özelliğini oluşturmayı tamamlamak için <code>author</code> parametresini <code>this.author</code> için bir değer olarak atayacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>author</code> ve son olarak <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>this</code> anahtar kelimesi oluşturulan nesneyi ifade eder. Özelliğine erişmek için nokta ve özellik adı ekle.</p><p>Yeni nesne özelliğini oluşturmayı bitirmek için <code>author</code> parametresini <code>this.author</code> değerine ata. Atamayı tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"title\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>author</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>author</code>, <code>;</code> ve son olarak <code>this</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
