          {
            "title": "Creating a class",
            "id": 108173,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sınıfımızı kullanma zamanı. Bir sabit oluştururken kullandığımız şekilde başlarız, ancak ardından <code>new</code> anahtar sözcüğünü ve <code>Book()</code> ifadesini ekleriz.</p><p>Burada <code>new Book()</code> değerini <code>book1</code> sabitine atayacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book();  \" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"119\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"125\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p /><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>new</code>, ardından <code>Book</code> ve son olarak <code>()</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Creating a class",
            "id": 108177,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ardından, yeni nesne için ayarlamak istediğimiz değerleri parantezlerin içine ekleyebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leo Tolstoy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;War and Peace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book1);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Book { author: 'Leo Tolstoy', title: 'War and Peace' }\" /></content></output></code><p /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
