            "id": 108174,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İşte bu kadar! Artık sınıfları kullanarak çok daha az kodla istediğimiz kadar kitap oluşturabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Book\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(author, title) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".author = author;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".title = title;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Leo Tolstoy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;War and Peace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" book2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Book(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Dr. Seuss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Oh, the Places You'll Go!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book1);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(book2);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Book { author: 'Leo Tolstoy', title: 'War and Peace' }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Book { author: 'Dr. Seuss', title: &quot;Oh, the Places You'll Go!&quot; }\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
